context:
DELETE /wiki/api/v2/comments/{comment-id}/properties/{property-id}
Deletes a content property for a comment by its id. **[Permissions](https://confluence.atlassian.com/x/_AozKw) required**: Permission to edit the comment.
Required: comment-id (path) — The ID of the comment the property belongs to.; property-id (path) — The ID of the property to be deleted.

GET /wiki/api/v2/comments/{comment-id}/properties/{property-id}
Retrieves a specific Content Property by ID that is attached to a specified comment. **[Permissions](https://confluence.atlassian.com/x/_AozKw) required**: Permission to view the comment.
Required: comment-id (path) — The ID of the comment for which content properties should be returned.; property-id (path) — The ID of the content property being requested.

PUT /wiki/api/v2/comments/{comment-id}/properties/{property-id}
Update a content property for a comment by its id. **[Permissions](https://confluence.atlassian.com/x/_AozKw) required**: Permission to edit the comment.
Required: comment-id (path) — The ID of the comment the property belongs to.; property-id (path) — The ID of the property to be updated.; body (body) — The content property to be updated.
